Aerie-Purpose: Let only the Aerie Guard panel's own WebUI bind aerie_guard.mojom.PageHandlerFactory.
Aerie-Upstream-Area: chrome/browser/chrome_browser_interface_binders_webui_parts_desktop.cc, chrome/browser/BUILD.gn
Aerie-Kind: hook

Issue #100. One registry.ForWebUI<AerieGuardUI>().Add<PageHandlerFactory>() line, after the one of
Tab Search. It binds no interface for any other controller and none for ordinary frames: the panel
stays Mojo-only (no chrome.send, no WebUIMessageHandler).

